OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission defends
OL,4,Aappointment of mediators for Drumcree
OL,5,Adispute
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Parades Commission has defended its
OL,8,Fappointment of a mediation organisation
OL,9,Fin relation to the Drumcree parading
OL,10,Fdispute.
OL,12,FThere has been criticism of how the
OL,13,Fcommission has handled the issue from
OL,14,Fthe Garvaghy Road Residents Coalition,
OL,15,Fwho said they had rejected the mediator
OL,16,Fon the basis they were not neutral.
OL,18,FThe route the Orange Order hopes to
OL,19,Ftake - including the mainly-nationalist
OL,20,FGarvaghy Road - has been published on
OL,21,Fthe Parades Commission website.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
