OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission defends
OL,4,Aappointment of mediators for Drumcree
OL,5,Adispute
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement issued on Friday, the
OL,8,Fcommission said it had "clarified" that
OL,9,FTIDES Mediation NI has a "network of
OL,10,Fqualified mediators and ensures that,
OL,11,Fin each mediation, those appointed are
OL,12,Freflective of all the communities
OL,13,Finvolved".
